WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.400
Two people. One job.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.800
Who pays first, and who takes the risk?

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1. The client locks the payment in escrow.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.600
45,000 practice credits move from Available to Held. Nobody can spend them.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.200
Step 2. The freelancer delivers the work.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:24.800
A SHA-256 fingerprint proves exactly what was delivered. The client gets a 3-day review.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.000
Step 3. The client approves.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:34.600
A 2% fee is taken and 44,100 credits are released to the freelancer, exactly once.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.600
Disagree? The funds freeze instantly and either side can raise a dispute.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.800
Both add evidence. An independent arbitrator decides: release, refund or split.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.800
Every step goes into a log nobody can quietly edit.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.700
TrustLock. Pay when it is delivered. Get paid when it is approved.

